## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Fable 5
- **Short description:** Anthropic’s Claude Fable 5 is the first generally released Mythos-class model (June 9, 2026), later superseded by Claude Fable 5.1. Public materials describe strong frontier capabilities, but clearly extractable standalone benchmark numbers for this exact model were limited in accessible sources during this pass.
- **Provider / access:** Anthropic Claude API `claude-fable-5`; available on Bedrock, Google Cloud, Microsoft Foundry, and Claude Platform on AWS per platform docs. No confirmed OpenCode Zen Free ID (`noFreeId` in local metadata).
- **Release / knowledge:** Released June 9, 2026 (platform docs/announcement). Reliable knowledge cutoff January 2026; training data cutoff January 2026.
- **IDs:** `claude-fable-5`, `anthropic.claude-fable-5` (Bedrock). Local metadata ID `opencode/claude-fable-5`.
- **Context window:** 1M tokens context, 128K max output (per docs).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Paid tier — $10 / 1M input, $50 / 1M output; cache read $1/MTok noted in metadata/docs context.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Anthropic model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

